{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB小生陳鍵鋒，近年因發現患有腦血管遺傳病而淡出幕前。</p><p>不過未有停下腳步積極轉型、持續自我增值，又曾遠赴泰國曼谷學廚藝，並入讀巴黎藍帶廚藝學校，更以第一名成績順利畢業。</p><p>近日他罕有現身私人飯局，與他曾合作拍無綫劇的麥子樂敍舊。</p><p>麥子樂於社交網</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:21:18.867766+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:01:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:20.664581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:20.664581+00:00","content_hash":"bcc8cc02b9373556772dac49bbfee70492fd306623b12a53fd11379ee7ed8b8d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}